  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "en",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "pcul27zrklhl",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Cultural Events In "
            },
            {
              "_key": "t5tbpy2izra7",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "bdajr7mgj894"
              ],
              "text": "Nuweiba"
            },
            {
              "_key": "6pqs0pr9ultt",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": A Haven of Tranquility and Unspoiled Beauty"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "bdajr7mgj894",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58892",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Nuweiba, a serene and unspoiled gem on the coast of the Sinai Peninsula, is a destination that stands apart not for its bustling events, but for the peace and tranquility it offers. This tranquil oasis is a haven for those looking to escape the frenetic pace of everyday life and immerse themselves in a setting of calm and relaxation."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The Allure of Serenity: Nuweiba’s Charm"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "In a world where every destination seems to be racing to offer the most grandiose "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000007"
              ],
              "text": "events"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " and attractions, Nuweiba is a refreshing exception. Here, the lack of high-profile events is not a shortfall but a unique selling point. This quiet coastal town invites visitors to embrace the slow pace and simplicity of life, away from the clamor and chaos of crowded tourist spots."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/home/dahab-historical-guide-4/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/dahab/dahab-historical-guide",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000c",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Relaxing Retreats: Nuweiba's Hospitalit"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000014",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The beauty of Nuweiba lies in its array of lovely "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000e"
              ],
              "text": "hotels"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " and resorts, each offering a sanctuary where time seems to stand still. These accommodations are not just places to stay; they are retreats where one can enjoy the gentle lapping of the "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000011"
              ],
              "text": "Red Sea"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " waves, the stunning mountainous backdrop, and the star-studded Sinai sky. Whether it’s lounging by the pool, enjoying a book on a sun-dappled balcony, or taking leisurely walks along the pristine beaches, Nuweiba provides the perfect setting for a truly relaxing vacation."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/things-to-do-in-aswan/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/aswan/things-to-do-in-aswan",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Red_Sea",
              "newTab": true
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000016",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Embracing Nature’s Rhythms"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "In Nuweiba, every day is an opportunity to reconnect with nature and oneself. The town’s natural beauty, from its crystal-clear waters to its rugged mountain terrain, "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000018"
              ],
              "text": "offers endless opportunities"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " for exploration and contemplation. Activities here are centered around enjoying the natural environment – be it snorkeling in the coral-rich waters, camel trekking in the nearby desert, or simply watching the sunset paint the sky in hues of orange and pink."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/historical-sites-visited-by-a-nile-cruise/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/blog/nairu-kuruzu-de-otozureru-rekishi-iseki",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001c",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/ahmad-ajmi-lhEhrBdMgfg-unsplash-1.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Close-up of a heavily burdened camel with colorful textiles in a rocky desert setting"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "A camel carries the vibrant essentials of nomadic life through the stark beauty of the desert"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001d",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/or-hakim-8mTeB8VxoHs-unsplash-1.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "A small boat rests on a pebbly shore with the calm blue sea in the background"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Embracing quiet moments where land and water meet"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "es",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "rxfh4vo8ryo4",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "3fcs1367dyuo"
              ],
              "text": "Nuweiba"
            },
            {
              "_key": "8o17h3wzqd5n",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": Un refugio de tranquilidad y belleza virgen"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "3fcs1367dyuo",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58892",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000007",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000002"
              ],
              "text": "Nuweiba"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", una joya serena y virgen en la costa de la península del Sinaí, es un destino que destaca no por sus bulliciosos acontecimientos, sino por la paz y tranquilidad que ofrece."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Este tranquilo oasis es un refugio para quienes buscan escapar del ritmo frenético de la vida cotidiana y sumergirse en un entorno de calma y relajación."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "http://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-nuweiba/estancia-en-nuweiba/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/guide/nuweiba/estancia-en-nuweiba",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000009",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El encanto de la serenidad: El Encanto de Nuweiba"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "En un mundo en el que todos los destinos parecen correr para ofrecer los acontecimientos y atracciones más grandiosos, Nuweiba es una refrescante excepción."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Aquí, la falta de eventos de alto nivel no es una carencia, sino un punto de venta único."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Esta tranquila ciudad costera invita a los visitantes a abrazar el ritmo lento y la sencillez de la vida, lejos del clamor y el caos de los abarrotados lugares turísticos. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000011",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Retiros relajantes: Hospitalit de Nuweiba"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "La belleza de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000013"
              ],
              "text": "Nuweiba"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " reside en su variedad de encantadores hoteles y complejos turísticos, cada uno de los cuales ofrece un santuario donde el tiempo parece detenerse."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Estos alojamientos no son sólo lugares donde alojarse; son retiros donde disfrutar del suave chapoteo de las olas del Mar Rojo, del impresionante telón de fondo montañoso y del cielo del Sinaí tachonado de estrellas."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Ya sea descansando junto a la piscina, disfrutando de un libro en un balcón bañado por el sol o dando tranquilos paseos por las playas vírgenes, Nuweiba ofrece el escenario perfecto para unas vacaciones verdaderamente relajantes."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nuweiba",
              "newTab": true
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001c",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Abrazar los ritmos de la naturaleza"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000022",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "En Nuweiba, cada día es una oportunidad para reconectar con la naturaleza y con uno mismo."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " La belleza natural de la ciudad, desde sus aguas cristalinas hasta su accidentado terreno montañoso, ofrece infinitas oportunidades de exploración y contemplación."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Las actividades aquí se centran en disfrutar del entorno natural, ya sea buceando en las aguas ricas en coral, haciendo senderismo en camello por el desierto cercano o simplemente contemplando cómo la puesta de sol pinta el cielo de tonos anaranjados y rosados. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000024",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000023",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Creado el 18 de marzo de 2020"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000026",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Actualizado en Ago , 2024"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "ja",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "rb6nyf0povpf",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "6007jvb48jih"
              ],
              "text": "ヌウェイバ"
            },
            {
              "_key": "3oigt1wzwgot",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "：静寂と手つかずの美の楽園"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "6007jvb48jih",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58892",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "ヌウェイバは、シナイ半島の海岸に位置する静寂で手つかずの宝石のような存在です。賑やかなイベントではなく、そこで感じられる平和と静けさこそが、この地を特別な目的地たらしめています。この穏やかなオアシスは、日常の慌ただしさから解放され、落ち着きとリラクゼーションに浸りたい人々のための楽園です。"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "静寂の魅力：ヌウェイバの魅力"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000007",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "華やかなイベントや観光名所の提供を競い合う世界において、ヌウェイバは新鮮な例外として際立っています。ここでは、大規模なイベントの不足は欠点ではなく、むしろ特別な魅力となっています。この静かな沿岸の町は、混雑した観光地の喧騒や混乱を離れて、スローペースでシンプルな生活を楽しむよう訪問者に促します。"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000009",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "リラックスできる隠れ家：ヌウェイバのホスピタリティ"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "ヌウェイバの美しさは、その魅力的なホテルやリゾートの数々にあります。それぞれが時間が止まったかのような静寂の中に佇む、癒しの場所です。これらの宿泊施設は、単なる滞在場所ではなく、紅海の穏やかな波音、壮大な山々の背景、そして星降るシナイの空を楽しむための隠れ家です。プールサイドでのんびりしたり、陽光が降り注ぐバルコニーで読書を楽しんだり、手つかずのビーチをゆっくりと歩いたりと、ヌウェイバは本当にリラックスできる休暇を過ごすための理想的な環境を提供します。"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "自然のリズムに身をゆだねて"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "ヌウェイバでは、毎日が自然と自分自身と再びつながる機会となります。この町の自然の美しさは、透き通った海からゴツゴツした山岳地帯まで、探検と瞑想の終わりなき可能性を提供してくれます。ここでのアクティビティは、自然環境を楽しむことに焦点を当てており、豊かな珊瑚礁が広がる海でのシュノーケリング、近隣の砂漠でのラクダトレッキング、または夕日が空をオレンジとピンクの色彩で染め上げる様子を静かに見守ることなど、さまざまな選択肢があります。"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000013",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "作成日：2020年3月18日"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
